  "goodToKnow": "Verheerend means devastating or disastrous: ein verheerendes Erdbeben, verheerende Folgen, ein verheerender Eindruck. It comes from verheeren, to lay waste, originally what an Heer (army) did to the land. In July 2021, verheerende floods hit the Ahr valley and other regions, killing more than 180 people in Germany. Synonyms: katastrophal, vernichtend."
